      "summary_en": "Jax's combat prowess allows him to dodge all incoming attacks for a short duration and then quickly counterattack, stunning all surrounding enemies.",
      "summary_zh": "贾克斯的武艺让他能够在短时间里躲闪掉所有即将到来的普通攻击，随后对所有周围的敌人快速发起反击，并将他们击晕。",
