      "summary_en": "Every third consecutive attack deals additional Magic Damage. Additionally, Jax can activate this ability to deal damage around himself and strengthen his resolve, increasing his Armor and Magic Resist for a short duration.",
      "summary_zh": "每连续攻击2次，第3次攻击就会造成额外的魔法伤害。另外，贾克斯可以激活这个技能来在他周围造成伤害并增强他的决心，从而暂时性地提升他的护甲和魔法抗性。",
